From 1d51a3bd368d99fd3baac1da8c5621ac3d1ec76a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noctis <970308389@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 00:51:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] llvm: enable the LoongArch backend on Android

SwiftShader's LLVM 16 already carries the LoongArch backend and Linux configuration, but its Android triples and generated Soong source lists omit it. Add the Android target configuration and teach the generators to retain it so Mesa can use LLVM-backed drivers on LoongArch64.

Change-Id: If0a0db01f72ee4670c33bbba372d9d7c6add6d72
---
